    "detailed_description": "Pass to Hell is a game where your choices lead to consequences. You will become Death and you will decide who is worthy to go to Heaven and who is to Hell.<br />\r\nThere is a struggle for power in Hell and you will have the opportunity to influence this event.<br />\r\nYour fate is in your hands, and it is up to you to decide how your story ends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will have the choice to send the person to heaven or hell.<br />\r\nYou can help revolutionaries.<br />\r\nMake an informed decision.<br />\r\nHelp the souls of people.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is in the genre of puzzle and &quot;Point and Click&quot;. You have to study the souls carefully to make an informed decision. Feel like a Judge who has studied the entire history of a person makes a decision. Your decisions affect not only the souls of people, but also you.<br />\r\nThe consequences of the decisions you make will catch up with you sooner than you think.",
